    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds like you're just saying it's a settled fact. but what about the argument that inclusion is a core part of fairness? people say that excluding trans athletes is discriminatory and harms the spirit of sport. you're basically saying their perspective doesn't even count as a valid way to look at fairness. isn't that a bit one-sided?",
